{"id": "EUVD-2026-93389", "enisaUuid": "ac0fa0ee-f3ce-33d7-9a1a-5737fbaeacbe", "description": "libmikmod before 3.3.14 contains an integer overflow vulnerability in DSM_Load() in load_dsm.c that allows attackers to trigger heap buffer overflow via crafted track counts. Attackers can supply a DSM module whose numchn and numpat product wraps a 16-bit value, overwriting heap memory to cause crashes or potential code execution.", "datePublished": "2026-10-06T13:35:43", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-06T19:30:57", "baseScore": 8.5, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/sezero/mikmod/commit/a125eabbd086f311496ae46d08aaebcad0a1c426", "https://github.com/sezero/mikmod/blob/libmikmod-3.3.13/libmikmod/loaders/load_dsm.c#L273", "https://github.com/sezero/mikmod/blob/libmikmod-3.3.14/libmikmod/NEWS", "https://github.com/sezero/mikmod", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libmikmod-before-3.3.14-heap-buffer-overflow-via-dsm-loader-integer-overflow"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-105837", "GHSA-rr6f-2vgw-5v76"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.15, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "b24eae3c-56ae-3b3d-9ab7-564e7e12386d", "product": {"name": "libmikmod", "vendor": {"name": "sezero"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.3.14"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4d17b2a2-34eb-3c2a-be31-261caca3d03d", "vendor": {"name": "sezero"}}], "isExploited": false}